ed his aid lesson last as he got to the end of high school.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":31,"wordEnd":45},{"id":3,"s":15.8,"e":17.58,"text":"And then of course he went on to college,","speaker":"S2","wordStart":46,"wordEnd":54},{"id":4,"s":18.6,"e":21.4,"text":"first at middle sex community and later at UMassalol.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":55,"wordEnd":63},{"id":5,"s":22.15,"e":31.43,"text":"But again, middle sex actually has some very good services And he had similar modifications up for those first couple of years.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":64,"wordEnd":85},{"id":6,"s":32.29,"e":35.03,"text":"And then after that, he really didn't eat them anymore.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":86,"wordEnd":95},{"id":7,"s":36.13,"e":41.09,"text":"So it was a journey of self -discovery for us.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":96,"wordEnd":105},{"id":8,"s":42.59,"e":44.95,"text":"Everybody's like, what's asked for her syndrome?","speaker":"S1","wordStart":106,"wordEnd":112},{"id":9,"s":45.67,"e":48.53,"text":"He was the first kid in his school to have that diagnosis.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":113,"wordEnd":124},{"id":10,"s":48.97,"e":51.27,"text":"So imagine today how different it is.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":125,"wordEnd":131},{"id":11,"s":51.27,"e":51.49,"text":"Okay,","speaker":"S1","wordStart":132,"wordEnd":132},{"id":12,"s":52.71,"e":59.15,"text":"but everybody worked hard to try to make opportunities for John and","speaker":"S1","wordStart":133,"wordEnd":144},{"id":13,"s":59.15,"e":64.07,"text":"he was in programs like the gifted art program when he was in junior high,","speaker":"S1","wordStart":145,"wordEnd":159},{"id":14,"s":64.97,"e":67.99,"text":"he was on the swim team, a Winchester high school.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":160,"wordEnd":169},{"id":15,"s":68.02,"e":75.02,"text":"So, it was a great learning for us going through this process.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":170,"wordEnd":181},{"id":16,"s":76.18,"e":77.6,"text":"But one that turned out","speaker":"S2","wordStart":182,"wordEnd":186},{"id":17,"s":77.6,"e":79.22,"text":"very well as you can tell.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":187,"wordEnd":192},{"id":18,"s":80.14,"e":83.34,"text":"So, we didn't even know what services to ask for to be honest.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":193,"wordEnd":205},{"id":19,"s":83.92,"e":90.2,"text":"Now, parents have a lot more resources at their, but also a lot more competition for the resources.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":206,"wordEnd":223},{"id":20,"s":90.7,"e":93.88,"text":"So, I know that's a big challenge for parents today.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":224,"wordEnd":233},{"id":21,"s":95.64,"e":101.96,"text":"Absolutely, well, that sounds like some journey inventing the wheel as you go.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":234,"wordEnd":246},{"id":22,"s":103.38,"e":103.38,"text":"So,","speaker":"S2","wordStart":247,"wordEnd":247},{"id":23,"s":103.78,"e":103.96,"text":"John,","speaker":"S1","wordStart":248,"wordEnd":248},{"id":24,"s":104.93,"e":106.53,"text":"this is from Mom's perspective.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":249,"wordEnd":253},{"id":25,"s":106.93,"e":112.41,"text":"From your perspective, is there anything you wish you had when you were growing up?","speaker":"S2","wordStart":254,"wordEnd":268},{"id":26,"s":112.43,"e":118.51,"text":"How do you think that in today's date when all this knowledge about autism exists?","speaker":"S2","wordStart":269,"wordEnd":283},{"id":27,"s":118.73,"e":121.65,"text":"How can the community support artists like you?","speaker":"S2","wordStart":284,"wordEnd":291},{"id":28,"s":122.04,"e":122.98,"text":"Well,","speaker":"S1","wordStart":292,"wordEnd":292},{"id":29,"s":123.98,"e":131.4,"text":"essentially they can support people up, such as myself by recognizing our strengths if you will.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":293,"wordEnd":308},{"id":30,"s":131.62,"e":137.5,"text":"And providing the opportunities to share whatever work we seem to excel at,","speaker":"S2","wordStart":309,"wordEnd":321},{"id":31,"s":138.3,"e":146.74,"text":"and this would provide not only motivation for us to pursue whatever our talents may be and to see where they may lead us.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":322,"wordEnd":345},{"id":32,"s":146.8,"e":155.08,"text":"So showing our work certainly gives us a way to interact with people which is quite difficult for example.","speaker":"S2","wordStart":346,"wordEnd":364},{"id":33,"s":160.62,"e":161.42,"text":"That's amazing.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":365,"wordEnd":366},{"id":34,"s":161.98,"e":163.34,"text":"That's very good feedback.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":367,"wordEnd":370},{"id":35,"s":163.54,"e":171.5,"text":"I think hearing it from a person who has this experience and is so accomplished is just so helpful.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":371,"wordEnd":389},{"id":36,"s":173.44,"e":173.94,"text":"Kathleen,","speaker":"S2","wordStart":390,"wordEnd":390},{"id":37,"s":174.24,"e":179.98,"text":"when did you realize that John had this gift with his arts.","speaker":"S1","wordStart":391,"wordEnd":402}]}